From: Shayne Legault <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:09:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] phy: apple-s5l-usb: Initialize S5L8942X after a cold handoff

An on-device iBEC file handoff can leave the common PHY and its parent
gates off. Use S5L8942X match data to restore the measured power and tuning
state, select the supplied reference clock and check reset completion.

Share initialization between OTG and HSIC. Keep the OTG enable bit in the
OTG power callbacks so connecting or disconnecting the gadget leaves HSIC
independent. Propagate parent-gate failures and preserve firmware tuning
for the legacy compatibles.

[Orchard: from shaynelegault/orchard#90 25379c1 (source range
 97d6283e22e8..55132508cfd5);
 moved to patches/armv7/usb; dropped the test notes from the commit
 message]

